{
  "title": "PGM / catalyst chain",
  "h1": "Platinum, palladium and rhodium have different supply maps",
  "deck": "South Africa supplies most platinum and rhodium, and Russia leads in palladium. Recycling and vehicle demand also differ by metal, so one figure for the group hides the exposure.",
